  "description": "YITAMOTOR floor mats completely line the interior carpet to provide all-encompassing protection. We are confident that our products will surpass your expectations and make you a happy customer!\nFitment\n2018-2024 Toyota Camry (Include Hybrid) L, LE, SE, XLE, and XSE\nOnly fit carpet floor,not fit vinyl flooring\nFor your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFeatures\n[Custom Fit]: Exclusivly made for Toyota Camry 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 2019 2018, these floor mats are fit like a glove. The precise 3D laser scanning technology provides the front and back floor area full protection. Only for carpet floor, Not for vehicles with vinyl floors.\n[Odorless & Non-slip]: Made from thickened TPE rubber, these tailored Camry floor mats are of great wear-resistance, odorless for long time use. These mats for Toyota Camry contain no latex, cadmium, lead, or harmful PVC, and special non-slip texture makes the liners stay in place firmly for safe driving experience.\n[All Weather Floor Mats] Our car floor mats feature anti-slip retainer clips, and textured surface which help keep the liners from shifting, flexible even in harsh cold or hot weather. The raised edge and deep ribs of the mat can effectively trap liquids, debris, snow, mud, sand, and other mess to render all round protection all year around.\n[Easy to Maintain]: The Toyota Camry car accessories are quite easy to install and clean. Simply remove the old mats, then place and snug our new liners. Shake off or hose down the mess from the floor liners after long time use, no need for harsh chemicals. The maintenance are easy to be done in minutes.\n[Why Choose YITAMOTOR]: YITAMOTOR floor mats are well made with state-of-the-art technology for edge to edge protection; The US-based teams deliver the floor liners of all-weather guard and built-to-last quality.",
